[Am]Woh Oo Oo Oo.. [Dm]woh Oo Oo Ooo.. [G]Woh Oo Oo Oo.. [Am]Woh Oo Oo Ooo...

[Am]Shakira Ve.. Shakira Ve Shakira Ve

[Dm]yah sinaruby-{c: 4 times}

[Am]Yeh dooriyaan.. [Dm]ab hai kahaan [G]yeh faasley.. [Am]na darmiyaan-{c: 2 times}

[G]badla badla sa hai [C]zamana

kha [G]moshiyan bhi hai gum [Am]shudaa..

[Yeh dooriyan part repeat]

flute lead-[Am]..[Dm]..[G]..[Am]..

[Am]O janiyaan.. koi mera dil le gaya

haan dekho [C]dekho zara dil se [F]hui khataa- {c: 2times}

strumming pattern at the beginning-DUDUU

rest of the song is same.
